                  "prompt": "Predict each output and justify it from the protocol, naming for each object whether it is an iterator:\n\n```\na = [1, 2, 3]\nprint(sum(a), sum(a))\n\nb = (x * 2 for x in a)\nprint(sum(b), sum(b))\n\nc = zip(a, a)\nprint(list(c), list(c))\n\nd = range(3)\nprint(list(d), list(d))\n```",
