                  "prompt": "Predict the output of each and explain the difference from the def-time theorem:\n\n```\ndef a(x, acc=[]):\n    acc.append(x)\n    return acc\n\ndef b(x, acc=[]):\n    acc = acc + [x]\n    return acc\n\nprint(a(1), a(2), a(3))\nprint(b(1), b(2), b(3))\n```",
