                  "prompt": "For each, decide whether the code should catch the exception at that layer, and justify from the boundary rule:\n\n(a) A JSON parser utility catching `JSONDecodeError` and returning `{}`.\n(b) A repository catching `sqlite3.OperationalError` and raising `Unavailable` from it.\n(c) A request handler catching `Exception`, logging with a traceback, and returning HTTP 500.\n(d) A `parse_date` helper catching `TypeError` and returning `None`.",
