                  "prompt": "State whether each is concurrent, and give the approximate wall-clock time if each `fetch` takes 1 second and there are 10 urls:\n\n(a) `[await fetch(u) for u in urls]`\n(b) `await asyncio.gather(*(fetch(u) for u in urls))`\n(c) `[fetch(u) for u in urls]` (no await at all)\n(d) `async with asyncio.TaskGroup() as tg: [tg.create_task(fetch(u)) for u in urls]`",
